      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "I want to stay in bed longer, and after a few minutes, I finally get out of bed.",
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "After I get up and prepare for school, the first day of my new week has started on this note.",
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "When my mother shouts at me to wake up, I don’t want to get up.",
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "For me, it is very hard to get out of bed every Monday morning.",
      "lang": "en"
